==English==
{{wikipedia|Fu Manchu moustache}}

===Etymology===
From the fictional character of [[w:Fu Manchu|Fu Manchu]], who was often depicted with such a style of moustache on film.

===Alternative spellings===
'''[[Fu-Manchu]]''' or '''[[Fu-Man-Chu]]'''

===Noun===
'''[[Fu]] [[Manchu]]''' 

# A long, thin [[moustache]] extending downward past the [[mouth]] and on either side of the [[chin]].

